  "function_summary": {
    "summary": "IXWebSocket 是一个面向 C++ 的跨平台网络库，核心提供 WebSocket 客户端与服务器实现，并附带 HTTP 客户端/服务器、TLS/SSL 加密、per-message deflate 压缩等能力。它主要面向需要在桌面/移动/嵌入式场景中集成 WebSocket 或 HTTP 通信的 C++ 开发者，既可被其他程序以库形式链接，也附带一个 ws 命令行工具用于测试与调试。",
    "categories": [
      {
        "name": "WebSocket 客户端",
        "description": "提供基于回调/事件驱动的 WebSocket 连接、消息收发、自动重连、Ping/Pong 与关闭协商。",
        "evidence": [
          "ixwebsocket/IXWebSocket.h",
          "ixwebsocket/IXWebSocketTransport.cpp"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "WebSocket 服务器",
        "description": "基于 TCP socket 监听、accept 与多线程处理，支持广播与连接状态管理。",
        "evidence": [
          "ixwebsocket/IXWebSocketServer.h",
          "ixwebsocket/IXSocketServer.cpp"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "HTTP 客户端/服务器",
        "description": "实现简易 HTTP 请求构造、响应解析、重定向跟随、chunked 传输与 gzip 解压。",
        "evidence": [
          "ixwebsocket/IXHttpClient.cpp",
          "ixwebsocket/IXHttpServer.cpp",
          "ixwebsocket/IXHttp.h"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "TLS/SSL 安全传输",
        "description": "通过可选后端（OpenSSL、LibreSSL、MbedTLS、Apple Secure Transport）为 socket 提供 TLS 加密与证书校验。",
        "evidence": [
          "ixwebsocket/IXSocketOpenSSL.cpp",
          "ixwebsocket/IXSocketMbedTLS.cpp",
          "ixwebsocket/IXSocketAppleSSL.cpp",
          "CMakeLists.txt:122-155"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "数据压缩",
        "description": "支持 WebSocket per-message deflate 扩展与 HTTP gzip 响应/请求压缩。",
        "evidence": [
          "ixwebsocket/IXWebSocketPerMessageDeflate.cpp",
          "ixwebsocket/IXGzipCodec.cpp"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "跨平台网络 I/O 抽象",
        "description": "封装 POSIX socket / poll 与 Windows WSA / select 的差异，提供统一 socket、连接、DNS 解析、线程命名接口。",
        "evidence": [
          "ixwebsocket/IXSocket.cpp",
          "ixwebsocket/IXNetSystem.cpp",
          "ixwebsocket/IXSocketConnect.cpp",
          "ixwebsocket/IXDNSLookup.cpp",
          "ixwebsocket/IXSetThreadName.cpp"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "domain": "networking",
    "target_users": "需要集成 WebSocket/HTTP 通信的 C++ 应用开发者与其它库"
  },
